{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24802","headline":"苏州元日郡斋感怀寄越州元相公杭州白舍人 · 李谅","name":"苏州元日郡斋感怀寄越州元相公杭州白舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"称庆还乡郡吏归，端忧明发俨朝衣。\n首开三百六旬日，新知四十九年非。\n当官补拙犹勤虑，游宦量才已息机。\n举族共资随月俸，一身惟忆故山薇。\n旧交邂逅封疆近，老牧萧条宴赏稀。\n书札每来同笑语，篇章时到借光辉。\n丝纶暂厌分符竹，舟檝初登拥羽旗。\n未知今日情何似，应与幽人事有违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李谅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}